{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_franka_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_franka_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"往日的象征","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_franka_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"0801890e03b09b5de23d91454bae75820c260c6997a17f1ff1a46de790614d06","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"控制距离！拉近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斩击！不要依赖刺击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然剑术基础是迅捷剑，但你的武器是长刀，所以不要太依赖刺击，我说过很多遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用道歉哦，多年的习惯确实不是那么好改的。迅捷剑术和长刀术很难融合，我也是一边教一边思考的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，芙兰卡小姐，我一直想问一个问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像，真的非常熟悉我的迅捷剑术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......毕竟，我在当雇佣兵之前，可是全哥伦比亚最有名的剑术老师呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"真......真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，本来上我的剑术课可是要付大价钱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那芙兰卡小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......骗你的，我才没有当过剑术老师呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，芙兰卡小姐又......可是，那又是为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像真的对迅捷剑术非常熟悉。我记得，上次您甚至说过“你在第三节课里学的刺击发力忘了吗”这样的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，为什么呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"控制距离！拉近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第三节课里学的刺击发力忘了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸......别哭别哭，唉，既然学了剑术就得好好学啊，我也不是故意的......别哭别哭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不谈这件事了，我们再来一遍。"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙兰卡举起剑，立于鼻尖之前。\n]\n发现破绽，刺击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"有机会......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"训练剑指在芙兰卡脖颈上的一瞬间，玫兰莎突然发现，老师的神情有些许恍惚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，我输了。这还是你第一次在训练里战胜我吧，小玫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"因为是芙兰卡小姐有一点......总之我要学的还很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我才没说你不需要学了。但是胜就是胜，值得表扬哦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她揉了揉玫兰莎的头发。\n她的脸上重新挂上了惯常的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......谢谢，芙兰卡小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我有点事情，接下来一个月可能不在罗德岛。不要荒废训练哦，小玫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？欸？芙兰卡小姐要去干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，我不是要打探的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有危险的话，还请注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有危险哦，只是最近有点太忙了，所以请了个假去旅游而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，时间差不多了，我该走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......我想起来了，刚才我训练小玫的时候，你也在一边训练。你听到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你请假到底是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是已经说了是旅游嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要那么不相信我嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪里旅游？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地上的大部分政治实体，都不欢迎感染者入境，你究竟想去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀哎呀，优等生小姐，难道你是在担心我会去做什么危险的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我不担心你，我只是担心你的行为会造成......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我很担心你，你刚才的状态很奇怪。如果有什么需要帮助的事，请你告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦......我真的不需要帮助。我保证，这次我要做的事没有任何危险性，就只是一点点私事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么那么熟悉迅捷剑术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这种事你都要这么追根究底的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"提起这件事后的那场对战，你原本不可能败的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"搭档的状态出现问题，及时关心是我的义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。其实呢，我是维多利亚奥比尼派剑术的继承人。因为天赋太强，在七岁的时候就已经名震伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至连上天也因此降罪于我，我八岁时莫名染上了矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父死后，为了寻找传说中的锻造师仅存于世的十二把剑，我离开了维多利亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"这是东国小说吧！而且你不是哥伦比亚人吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，其实我在八岁的时候做过一个梦，醒来之后，我跟随梦的指引去了一座偏僻的废弃城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那里遇到了一只巨大的羽兽，它用自己的羽毛作剑刺穿猎物。年幼的我看着它的技艺，突然领悟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能有这种羽兽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......这个故事也不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，机缘巧合下，偶然得到了炎国剑术大师传授的秘籍之类的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，别开玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的是不愿意告诉任何人的事，那就让我说声抱歉好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"谁都有不想告诉别人的事，这不需要花大力气去遮掩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇小姐......请问，芙兰卡小姐她，还没有回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我刚问过博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"那么博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"博士什么也没说，只是让我不要担心，芙兰卡会准时回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我还是很担心......芙兰卡小姐离开前的状态，好像有一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心她了，她不会有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好感人的对话啊，优等生小姐，小玫~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡小姐......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了。事不宜迟，小玫，我们来看看这一个月里，你有没有退步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"喝——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"斩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错嘛，小玫，看来我不在的时候也没有荒废练习，斩击和刺击之间的衔接已经流畅很多了，值得表扬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......芙兰卡小姐，那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，小玫？突然之间发现我的帅气之处，想要表达崇拜？这样的话，突然扑到我怀里也可以的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......您看起来开心了不少，我很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，继续训练，今天的基础架势练习你做了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玫，我记得，你的家境其实还不错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"其实不值一提......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，哪怕你不战斗，你家也能负担得起矿石病的治疗费用。你一开始学习剑术，也只是为了强身健体而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么要战斗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病在初期的时候，曾经让我拥有过强大的感知能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候我在罗德岛，看到大家都在为同为感染者的同胞们努力，就觉得......既然有了这样的能力，那我也要为他们做点什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，试试看也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"一开始的时候是这样。后来，那种感知能力渐渐消退，而且我的父母......也已经很久都联系不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我很庆幸当初做出了这样的选择......我已经认识了很多重要的同伴，而且，即使没有父母，我也能靠自己的力量活下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很励志的故事呢，小玫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡小姐，又是为什么而战斗呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我是个雇佣兵呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫兰莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小玫，先得到战斗的理由再去战斗，是件非常幸运的事哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，接下来的对话，就不是你应该听的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"优等生小姐，你终于发现啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡......你在我的宿舍里放的东西，到底是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所见，就是一封信哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你请假一个月，其实是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，我回来报到啦，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很准时。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（签字）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你还好吗？雷蛇很担心你。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"去见见你的搭档吧，她很担心你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真的吗？居然打扰到博士，真是不应该，应该好好训训她才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她没有打扰到我。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？博士还真是好心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那挺好，一个月没见到你们拌嘴，挺无聊的。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，没想到博士还挺关心我们的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......或许是我多嘴了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"有些事情，说出来可能会更舒服一些。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士说得没错。\n我该抛掉一些东西，才能继续前进。\n释怀最好的方式或许就是......像倒垃圾一样，先丢出去再说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，是去安葬我的母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遗憾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前不是很想知道我为什么那么熟悉小玫的剑术吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的剑术基础是标准的维多利亚花剑剑术，维多利亚上层社会女性强身健体的首选——当然，只是些花拳绣腿，没什么实用性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种剑术的套路没什么秘密，第一节课熟悉剑、第二节课摆架势、第三节课学发力......哪国都一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我当年也学过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，那不是上层社会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，上层社会......我也曾经是其中的一员来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家乡叫吉沃吉亚，是哥伦比亚的一座大城......没听说过是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它在我十三岁的时候毁于天灾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别过去！芙兰卡......别过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父亲在天灾中失踪，母亲和我当时刚好去了郊外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在看到天灾云时匆忙赶到城外，只看到了......满地都是被源石结晶撕碎的建筑残骸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母亲用剩下的储蓄和保险金带我去了另一个城市安家，但她很快积劳成疾，患上重病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，毕业之后，我凭借曾经的剑术基础当了自由佣兵——直到我遇到了朗费罗博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后的故事，你都在黑钢的档案里见过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真没想到优等生小姐也会露出这种表情。其实，刚才那个故事也是在开玩笑哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，别生气，故事是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你刚才的表情很失礼哦，优等生小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事啦，这么多年过去了，以前的事我早就放下了。妈妈也重病了很多年，这种事谁也不会感到意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真的过意不去，不如请我喝杯红茶好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就是因为这样，就是因为不想看到这种恻隐的表情，我才不想告诉任何人的。\n不过......说出来之后，好像反而不那么介意了。\n过去的事已经过去了，还不如期待一下未来吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？优等生小姐难得在路上跟我搭话，难道还在对什么事耿耿于怀吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"三个月假期批准。我认为你需要更多的时间进行心理调节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个月就是夏天了，你可以选择休息一段时间，或者趁这段假期找个地方度假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......我先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......度假的话，你不想和我一起去吗，优等生小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一封已经展开过很多次的信件——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]},{"speakerId":"char_208_melan","aliases":["玫兰莎"]}]}
